		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4512&amp;p=33635#p33635"><![CDATA[
A new version of the OpenGD77CPS is available to download<br><br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/PC_CPS/Latest/OpenGD77CPSInstaller_R2024.10.23.01.exe" class="postlink">downloads/PC_CPS/Latest/OpenGD77CPSInst ... .23.01.exe</a><br><br>This version fixes a bug for on the DMR ID screen, for 'portable' installations.<br><br>'Portable' installations are an option in the installer to allow the CPS to be installed onto a memory stick etc, and uses file based storage for the various settings that it stores e.g. radio type<br><br>Note. <br>When using portable installations, the location of the donor file will be stored as an absolute path, so if you use this on a memory stick, the donor file will not be found if the driver letter assigned to the donor file changes depending on which computer you insert the memory stick into.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Tue Oct 22, 2024 9:30 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
